title:
“The killing of peaceful demonstrators must stop, and the labelling of protesters as ‘terrorists’ to justify violence against them is unacceptable.”

@unitednationshumanrights chief Volker Türk urges Iranian authorities to end all forms of violence against protestors, restore full access to the internet and telecommunications, and ensure accountability. 

